{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Noxious Trap|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Teemo
|skill        = R
|icon         = Noxious Trap.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Teemo}} tosses a poisonous mushroom to the target location that becomes {{tip|stealthed trap|stealthed}} and lasts for a while. It will bounce forward upon landing on another mushroom.
|blurb2       = '''Teemo''' periodically [[ammunition|stocks]] a charge of ''Noxious Trap'', up to a cap.
|blurb3       = Mushrooms can be destroyed by enemy {{tip|basic attacks}} and will explode upon enemy contact, inflicting {{tip|poison}} to nearby enemies and {{tip|slow|slowing}} them for a few seconds, as well as {{tip|standard sight|revealing}} them.
|blurb4       = {{sbc|{{tip|poison|nolink=true}}:}} The target takes {{as|magic damage}} every second over a few seconds. Subsequent inflictions refresh the duration.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Teemo''' tosses a poisonous mushroom to the target location that becomes {{tip|stealthed trap|stealthed}} after arming over 1 second, lasting for up to 5 minutes and granting {{tip|sight}} of its surroundings. If the mushroom lands on one that has already been placed, it will bounce forward from the placed mushroom for its cast distance, up to a cap, which can {{tt|happen repeatedly|In-flight mushrooms can chain into further bounces if they keep landing on subsequent placed mushrooms}}.
|leveling     = {{st|Bounce Distance Cap|{{ap|350 to 550}}}}
|description2 = '''Teemo''' periodically [[ammunition|stocks]] a ''Noxious Trap'' charge, up to a maximum amount.
|leveling2    = {{st|Maximum Charges|{{ap|3 to 5}}}}
|description3 = The mushroom will explode upon enemy contact, inflicting {{tip|poison}} to nearby enemies and {{tip|slow|slowing}} them for 4 seconds, as well as {{tip|standard sight|revealing}} them.
|leveling3    = {{st|Slow|{{ap|30 to 50}}%}}
|description4 = {{sbc|{{tip|poison|nolink=true}}:}} The target takes {{as|magic damage}} every second over 4 seconds. Subsequent inflictions refresh the duration.
|leveling4    = {{st|Magic Damage per Tick|{{ap|200/4 to 450/4}} {{as|(+ {{ap|50/4}}% AP)}}|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|200 to 450}} {{as|(+ 50% AP)}}}}
|description5 = A mushroom has {{sti|health|{{as|6 '''maximum''' health}}}} and can only be damaged by {{tip|champion}} basic attacks (2 damage from {{tip|ranged}} and 3 from {{tip|melee}}).
|description6 = ''See [[Teemo#Pets|Pets]] for more details about mushroom traps.''
|target range = {{ap|600 to 900}}
|collision radius = {{dv|{{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|160|Triggering radius}}|{{tt|150|Bounce collision radius}}}}
|effect radius    = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} 450
|cooldown     = {{fd|0.25}}
|recharge     = {{ap|35 to 25}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|cost         = {{ap|75 to 35}}
|costtype     = Mana + 1 Charge
|targeting    = Location
|damagetype   = Magic
|affects      = Enemies
|projectile   = True
|spelleffects = special
|spellshield  = Special
|outofrange   = walk to location
|notes  = 
* ''Noxious Trap'' deals {{tip|persistent area damage}}, additionally tagged as {{tip|indirect damage}}, and applies {{tip|spell effects}}.
* The bounce can occur an indefinite amount of times while '''Teemo''' is alive. If '''Teemo''' dies before ''Noxious Trap'' bounces on another, the trap will disappear.
* {{ui|Rift Scuttler}} will not trigger ''Noxious Trap's'' explosion if it is not being attacked.
* Enemies who step on multiple ''Noxious Traps'' will only refresh the duration of the damage over time and slow.
* ''Noxious Trap's'' damage is determined when it detonates and not when planted, meaning if '''Teemo's''' {{sti|AP|{{as|ability power}}}} changes, the scaling is also altered to affect the active damage of all ''Noxious Traps'' so long as they do not explode.
* {{tip|Spell shield}} will prevent the damage over time and slow for all units but will not prevent the detonation itself.
}}

